      phonetique: 'Liyamizallahul-khabitha minat-tayyibi wa yaj\'alal-khabitha ba\'dahu \'ala ba\'din fayarkumahu jami\'an fayaj\'alahu fi jahannama ula\'ika humul-khasirun',
