      phonetique: 'Wala\'in akhkharnā \'anhumu l-\'adhāba ilā ummatin ma\'dūdatin layaqūlunna mā yaḥbisuhu alā yawma ya\'tīhim laysa maṣrūfan \'anhum waḥāqa bihim mā kānū bihi yastahzi\'ūn',
