      phonetique: 'Waḍaraba llāhu mathalan rajulayni aḥaduhumā abkamu lā yaqdiru \'alā shay\'in wahuwa kallun \'alā mawlāhu aynamā yuwajjihhū lā ya\'ti bikhayrin hal yastawī huwa waman ya\'muru bil-\'adli wahuwa \'alā ṣirāṭin mustaqīm',
